---
description: >-
  Entity name aliases: a bare identifier alias (p[Person]) and a quoted-string
  alias (c["Customer Account"]) under the elk layout.
config:
  layout: elk
---
erDiagram
  p[Person] {
    varchar(64) firstName
    varchar(64) lastName
  }
  c["Customer Account"] {
    varchar(128) email
  }
  p ||--o| c : has
